    "title": "City of Beaufort PIO Ashley Brandon resigns - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago Ashley Brandon, the City of Beaufort’s Public Information Officer, has resigned her post, City Manager Scott Marshall announced during the March 10 regular City Council meeting. “After nearly three years with us, she is moving on to bigger and better opportunities,” Marshall said, offering a public thank-you to Brandon... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
